Add a client-local tab bar toggle to Herdr.

Adds keys.toggle_tab_bar (default "prefix+t") and ui.tab_bar_start_hidden
(default false). Hiding the bar gives its row to the pane surface.

Base: github.com/herdrdev/herdr tag v0.9.3, the source nixpkgs builds
(src hash sha256-uu452Xe23pSvFk7w7fKPjiaqY5QenUIljao2SFAxpc0=).
Touches no protocol, codec, or persisted state.

